Package: streamline-vectors
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Free vector icons from Streamline
 This package contains a comprehensive collection of free vector icons
 designed by the Streamline professional team. The icons are organized
 in various categories including core, block, flex, sharp, plump, and more.
 .
 All icons are provided in SVG format and are licensed under Creative
 Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0).

Package: streamline-find
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, streamline-vectors, sqlite3, bash-completion, bash-shlib
Description: Command-line tools to search and index Streamline icons
 This package provides tools for working with the Streamline icon collection:
 .
 streamline-find: Search through the icon collection by filename, category,
 style, or subcategory. Results are ranked by relevance and displayed in
 descending order of match quality. Uses an SQLite index for fast searching.
 .
 streamline-index: Build and maintain the search index for the icon collection.
 .
 The search index is included in the package for immediate use.
